    {
      "id": "instructions",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 📖 HOW TO USE THIS DASHBOARD\n\n**Daily workflow (5 min):**\n1. 12:05 AM: Hermes messages you\n2. Say **\"what posts today?\"** in chat\n3. Hermes shows video + caption\n4. Post to FB/IG/TikTok/YT/WA Status\n5. Say **\"posted\"** in chat\n6. Hermes logs to sent-log, archives video, queues tomorrow\n\n**Weekly planning:**\n- Open this Canvas Sunday after batch render\n- Review all 7 videos, check sequence\n- Click [[SCRIPT.md]] links to review scripts\n- Reorder if needed (tell Hermes \"swap wed/thu\")\n\n**Status colors:**\n- 🟦 QUEUED = ready to post\n- ✅ POSTED = done, logged to sent-log\n- ⚠️ SKIPPED = rescheduled\n\n**Commands:**\n- `what posts today?` — show today's video\n- `posted` — mark posted, log, archive\n- `queue status` — show full week\n- `skip [day]` — reschedule video\n- `ingest batch YYYY-MM-DD` — rebuild queue after render\n\n---\n\n**This Canvas auto-updates** after you say \"posted\" or \"skip\" in chat.\n\nIf stuck, say **\"queue help\"** in chat.",
      "x": 1110,
      "y": 610,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "5"
    }
